Chapter: MagicShuffleSeeds

  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites CodexMagic chapter Deck

 A fair shuffle reads about 100 of 199 on the 2-card line and about 20 of
 199 on the top-card line; an LCG read raw reads 199 on both. The first
 line cannot see that defect and reads about 100 either way.

 We say:

Section: Probe

  fresh : Integer, Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  fresh (i) (n) (acc) =
    if i >= n then acc
    else fresh (i + 1) n (list-push acc i)

  pair-follows-parity : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  pair-follows-parity (seed) (last) (acc) =
    if seed > last then acc
    else let d = shuffle-deck (fresh 0 10 []) seed
    in let ordered = if list-at d 0 < list-at d 1 then 1 else 0
    in let odd = seed - (seed / 2) * 2
    in pair-follows-parity (seed + 1) last (acc + (if ordered == odd then 1 else 0))

  two-swapped : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  two-swapped (seed) (last) (prev) (acc) =
    if seed > last then acc
    else let d = shuffle-deck (fresh 0 2 []) seed
    in let now = list-at d 0
    in two-swapped (seed + 1) last now (acc + (if now == prev then 0 else 1))

  top-steps : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  top-steps (seed) (last) (prev) (acc) =
    if seed > last then acc
    else let d = shuffle-deck (fresh 0 10 []) seed
    in let top = list-at d 9
    in let step = if top == (prev + 1) - ((prev + 1) / 10) * 10 then 1 else 0
    in top-steps (seed + 1) last top (acc + step)

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening =
    let a = pair-follows-parity 1 200 0
    in let b = two-swapped 2 200 (list-at (shuffle-deck (fresh 0 2 []) 1) 0) 0
    in let c = top-steps 2 200 (list-at (shuffle-deck (fresh 0 10 []) 1) 9) 0
    in act
      print-line-uni ("10-card deck, first two cards ordered iff seed odd: " & show a & " of 200")
      print-line-uni ("2-card deck, swap differs from the previous seed's: " & show b & " of 199")
      print-line-uni ("10-card deck, top card is last seed's plus one: " & show c & " of 199")
    end

